@startuml
title BinMorph Testable Core Components

component "binmorph executable" as Cli
component "FilesystemApplicationIO" as FsIo
interface "IApplicationIO" as Io
component "binmorph_core" as Core
component "GoogleTest / GoogleMock tests" as Tests

Cli --> FsIo : constructs
FsIo ..|> Io
Cli --> Core : runProduction()
Core --> Io : runInspect(options, io)
Tests ..> Core : unit tests
Tests ..> Io : mock implementation

note right of Core
Parser, schema compiler, BinaryView,
interpreter, renderer, and CLI
orchestration live here.
end note

note bottom of FsIo
Filesystem/stdin/stdout access remains
at the production composition boundary.
end note

@enduml
